  · exact shiftedTerminalE1CutoffMinus_eq_zero_of_not_mem_Icc C j s q a n ratio r hratio xi
  · exact shiftedTerminalE1PhasePlus_eq_zero_of_not_mem_Icc C j s q a n ratio r hratio xi
